### 查看实例设置（管理员）
GET {{baseUrl}}/system/settings/get
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 修改实例设置（管理员）
PUT {{baseUrl}}/system/settings/update
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"mcpEnabled":true,"mcpRateLimitPerMinute":60,"ingestGlobalConcurrency":2,"ingestKnowledgeBaseConcurrency":1}
